.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Chirantan Ekbote &lt;chirantan@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="410262" owner_email="zachr@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="1" project="chromiumos/platform2" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform2" ref="refs/changes/62/410262/1" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="chromeos-3.18" change_id="I253b75d105f7e5460cebb2b8ea9838ad5fcda56a" commit="4a1f71c3a395785595a74d93cdbc5a4940df584b" commit_message="UPSTREAM: Input: melfas_mip4 - add product_id sysfs attribute  Add product_id sysfs attribute and update protocol version to support it.  Signed-off-by: Sangwon Jee &lt;jeesw@melfas.com&gt; Signed-off-by: Dmitry Torokhov &lt;dmitry.torokhov@gmail.com&gt; (cherry picked from commit e2aad66638f995f825e637ef621f45d902c130d1)  BUG=chrome-os-partner:56704 TEST=Reks. Run cat product_id. Tested with MIT400 and MIT410.  Change-Id: I253b75d105f7e5460cebb2b8ea9838ad5fcda56a Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/410628 Commit-Ready: Sangwon Jee &lt;jeesw@melfas.com&gt; Tested-by: Sangwon Jee &lt;jeesw@melfas.com&gt; Reviewed-by: Sangwon Jee &lt;jeesw@melfas.com&gt; Reviewed-by: Charlie Mooney &lt;charliemooney@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="410628" owner_email="jeesw@melfas.com" pass_count="0" patch_number="1" project="chromiumos/third_party/kernel" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/kernel" ref="refs/changes/28/410628/1" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I688ea72a5e0abb5188d801f753e65bb330bdc43e" commit="11e0485dd9b2f43acfd5f9fee8846d5a564c48a5" commit_message="retry.py: provide more information in timeout exception message  This changes the message &quot;call is timed out&quot; to something like &quot;sigalarm timeout (### seconds) in FooBar&quot;.  Also changes the exception message for some of the other exceptions which used to have the &quot;call is timed